{"id": "1007ec5e-8098-437d-bb35-63de1d10bce8", "slug": "nexus-digital-studio", "title": "Nexus - Digital Studio", "description": "Nexus Digital Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus - Digital Studio\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Digital Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#191C21\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#A1A1AA\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Digital Studio\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 328; favorites: 20; remixes: 3.\nTags: section, animated, bento, social-proof, branding.\n## Overview\nNexus Digital Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNEXUS® INDEX WORK AGENCY INSIGHTS START A PROJECT We design identities, platforms, and interactive journeys [ OUR MISSION ] We are a digital studio partnering with forward-thinking companies to scale from 'emerging' to…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: We design identities, platforms, and interactive journeys; We are a digital studio partnering with forward-thinking companies to scale from 'emerging' to iconic. Our approach fuses data, aesthetics, and code to produce measurable impact.; Brand Identity; Web Development; UI/UX Design; Copywriting.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #191C21, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Digital Studio</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        black: '#0a0a0a',\n                        dark: '#111111',\n                        gray: {\n                            100: '#f4f4f5',\n                            200: '#e4e4e7',\n                            300: '#d4d4d8',\n                            400: '#a1a1aa',\n                            500: '#71717a',\n                            600: '#52525b',\n                            800: '#27272a',\n                            900: '#18181b',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f4f4f5;\n            margin: 0;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        .text-balance { text-wrap: balance; }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal Styles */\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n        .reveal-word span {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Background */\n        #canvas-container {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n\n        /* Gradient Borders */\n        .gradient-border-card {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #000;\n            border-radius: 0;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-card::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: 0;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        .light-gradient-border {\n            position: relative;\n            background: #fff;\n        }\n        .light-gradient-border::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Service List Hover */\n        .service-item {\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n        .service-item:hover {\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .service-item:hover .service-number {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n        .service-number {\n            opacity: 0.3;\n            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .service-active {\n            color: white;\n        }\n        .service-active .service-number {\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-black overflow-x-hidden antialiased\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Page Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto bg-white shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"relative h-[80vh] min-h-[600px] w-full bg-[#d0d0d2] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-12\">\n\n            <!-- Background Image -->\n            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/b3738db4-e122-4f81-a199-9ae2536b9357_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Abstract Portrait\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center mix-blend-multiply opacity-90 z-0\">\n\n            <!-- Nav -->\n            <nav class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-center w-full\">\n                <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider\">NEXUS®</div>\n                <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-1 bg-black text-white rounded-full p-1 text-xs font-medium\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/20\">INDEX</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition\">WORK</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition\">AGENCY</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition\">INSIGHTS</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-black ml-1\">START A PROJECT</a>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"md:hidden text-white bg-black p-2 rounded-full\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"20\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Hero Text -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-2xl text-white mix-blend-difference mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-balance js-reveal-text\">\n                    We design identities, platforms, and interactive journeys\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Who We Are Section -->\n        <section class=\"py-24 px-6 md:px-12 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_3fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24\">\n\n                <!-- Label -->\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    [ OUR MISSION ]\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Content -->\n                <div class=\"space-y-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.3] text-balance js-reveal-text\">\n                        We are a digital studio partnering with forward-thinking companies to scale from 'emerging' to iconic. Our approach fuses data, aesthetics, and code to produce measurable impact.\n                    </h2>\n\n                    <!-- Stats -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pt-8 border-t border-gray-100\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">$10M+</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Value Created for Partners</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">30+</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Global Markets</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-2\">150+</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Digital Products Launched</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Logos -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8 pt-12 opacity-60 grayscale\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-lg\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon> AcmeCorp</div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-lg\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:asteroid-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon> STELLAR</div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-lg\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:crown-star-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon> Vertex</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Services Section (Dark) -->\n        <section class=\"py-24 px-6 md:px-12 bg-black text-white relative\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_3fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24\">\n\n                <!-- Left Column -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between h-full space-y-12\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                        [ CAPABILITIES ]\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-48 h-48 bg-gray-900 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/5180d964-2425-4134-8220-c1528af09124_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Service Detail\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale\">\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed max-w-[200px]\">\n                            We establish the core pillars of your positioning and design language, building a scalable framework for your future.\n                        </p>\n                        <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium bg-white text-black px-4 py-2 hover:bg-gray-200 transition\">\n                            View Case Studies <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Right Column (Service List) -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center space-y-6 md:space-y-8 pb-12 md:pb-0\">\n                    <div class=\"service-item service-active flex items-end justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Brand Identity</h3>\n                        <span class=\"service-number text-xs font-mono mb-2\">[001]</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-item text-gray-600 flex items-end justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Web Development</h3>\n                        <span class=\"service-number text-xs font-mono mb-2\">[002]</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-item text-gray-600 flex items-end justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight\">UI/UX Design</h3>\n                        <span class=\"service-number text-xs font-mono mb-2\">[003]</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-item text-gray-600 flex items-end justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Copywriting</h3>\n                        <span class=\"service-number text-xs font-mono mb-2\">[004]</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"service-item text-gray-600 flex items-end justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-4\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Spatial Computing</h3>\n                        <span class=\"service-number text-xs font-mono mb-2\">[005]</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Process Grid -->\n            <div class=\"mt-32\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-12\">\n                    [ METHODOLOGY ]\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-gray-800 border border-gray-800\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card p-6 h-48 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-mono text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>[ 01</span>\n                            <span>+</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium\">Research &amp;<br>Audit</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card p-6 h-48 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-mono text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>[ 02</span>\n                            <span>+</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium\">Concept &amp;<br>Wireframes</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card p-6 h-48 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-mono text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>[ 03</span>\n                            <span>+</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium\">Code &amp;<br>Animation</h4>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-card p-6 h-48 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-mono text-gray-500\">\n                            <span>[ 04</span>\n                            <span>+</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium\">QA &amp;<br>Deployment</h4>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Why Choose Us / Banners -->\n        <section class=\"py-24 px-6 md:px-12 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_3fr] gap-12 lg:gap-24 mb-16\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    [ THE ADVANTAGE ]\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-balance js-reveal-text max-w-xl\">\n                        An independent studio for visionaries who refuse to blend in.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bento Grid -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4\">\n\n                <!-- Large Image Card -->\n                <div class=\"md:col-span-5 relative h-80 light-gradient-border overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/005600e5-f6ab-4e59-bc86-eaeb02797dfa_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Studio\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-wider\">Nexus HQ®</div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 text-white text-xs\">Est. 2015</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Testimonial & Graph -->\n                <div class=\"md:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n\n                    <!-- Testimonial -->\n                    <div class=\"light-gradient-border p-6 h-80 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                            <div class=\"flex -space-x-2\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_1600w.jpg\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex text-xs text-gray-500 items-center\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" class=\"text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" class=\"text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" class=\"text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" class=\"text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-bold\" class=\"text-black\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"ml-2\">Loved by leaders</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mt-4\">\n                            \"Partnering with Nexus transformed our digital presence. Our conversion rate doubled in weeks, and the aesthetic finally matches our ambition. They truly understand modern commerce.\"\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Stats Cards -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-rows-2 gap-4 h-80\">\n                        <div class=\"light-gradient-border p-6 bg-gray-50 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div>\n                                <div class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-1\">$50M+</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500\">E-commerce revenue tracked</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Simple CSS Bar chart representation -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-end gap-1 h-12 mt-4 opacity-30\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[20%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[30%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[40%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[60%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[50%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[70%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[90%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[80%]\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"w-full bg-black h-[100%]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"light-gradient-border p-6 bg-white flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] relative overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                                <div class=\"text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-1\">300+</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-500 leading-tight max-w-[150px]\">From London to Tokyo, our output transcends borders. We execute globally.</div>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:earth-linear\" class=\"absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 text-7xl text-gray-100\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // Register GSAP plugins\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Masked Text Reveal Animation\n        function setupTextReveal() {\n            const textElements = document.querySelectorAll('.js-reveal-text');\n\n            textElements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n\n                words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                    const wordDiv = document.createElement('div');\n                    wordDiv.className = 'reveal-word';\n                    const space = i < words.length - 1 ? '&nbsp;' : '';\n                    wordDiv.innerHTML = `<span>${word}</span>${space}`;\n                    el.appendChild(wordDiv);\n                });\n\n                gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('span'), {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.02,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: 'top 85%',\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        // WebGL Dots Background Animation (Enhanced Visibility)\n        function initWebGL() {\n            const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 50;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 800;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 150;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.18,\n                color: '#3f3f46',\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.6\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const tick = () => {\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - particlesMesh.rotation.y);\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - particlesMesh.rotation.x);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                window.requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n            };\n\n            tick();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize scripts\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            setupTextReveal();\n            if(window.innerWidth > 768) {\n                initWebGL();\n            }\n        });\n\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-digital-studio.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-digital-studio.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-digital-studio-DESIGN.md", "views": 929, "forks": 32, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:43:35.592916+00:00"}